processes/electromagnetic
-------------------------
- dna (emdna-V11-03-20)
  o Extended G4DNAELSEPAElasticModel up to 10 MeV for water.
    Requires new data-set G4EMLOW-8.8.
  o Changed the condition in calculateDistanceFromTimeStep() in     
    G4ChemReboundTransportation, to allow for calculating even with zero
    DiffusionCoefficient.
  o In G4DNARuddIonisationDynamicModel, use G4ExtendedPhysicsVector for data;
    results are unchanged, performance should be improved.
- standard (emstand-V11-03-14)
  o G4GoudsmitSaundersonMscModel, G4GoudsmitSaundersonTable, G4GSMottCorrection,
    and G4GSPWACorrections: removed all other electron stepping and boundary
    crossing algorithms from the Goudsmit-Saunderson multiple-scattering model,
    except its accurate one; updated the class descriptions, no physics change
    is expected in the Livermore, Penelope and standard option4 EM constructors
    while the standard GS constructor now will be more accurate.
  o G4UrbanMscModel: changed 'geommin' parameter value from 10^-3 mm to
    10^-6 mm; this change is effective to EM option3 physics configuration.
  o G4eBremsstrahlungRelModel, G4PairProductionRelModel: simplifed handling of
    LPM functions by precomputing and factoring the related data to a new
    G4LPMFunction (header only) utility.
- utils (emutils-V11-03-14)
  o G4VXRayModel, G4OpticalParameters: added extra methods needed for new
    Cerenkov processes and models.
- xrays (xrays-V11-03-04)
  o Added new classes G4GeneralCerenkov and G4StandardCerenkovModel with the
    first implementation of the model approach for X-Ray processes G4Cerenkov,
    G4Scintillation and G4GeneralCerenkov; fixed IsApplicable(..) method for
    UnknownParticle type; use dynamic charge and kinematics for these processes.

